"value":"[[\"n\", \"“Red Hare. A thousand li a day, and he bites.”\", \"“赤兔。日行千里，还会咬人。”\", \"86d398257e43\"]]"},{"name":"gives","type":"string","value":"redhare"},{"name":"gives_when","type":"string","value":"node:c7"},{"name":"give","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"The stable master brings out a horse red as coals, and puts the halter in your hand. “Mind his teeth.”\", \"马夫牵出一匹赤如炭火的马，把缰绳交到你手里。“当心它的牙。”\", \"03fb36323f2f\"]]"},{"name":"given","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"“Red Hare's gone, then. The stall looks empty without him.”\", \"“赤兔牵走了。没了它，马棚都显得空了。”\", \"cbcc0f256b1c\"]]"}]},{"id":92,"name":"npc-2","type":"npc","x":1400.0,"y":238.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true,"properties":[{"name":"kind","type":"string","value":"folk.official"},{"name":"sprite","type":"string","value":"f_official"},{"name":"wander","type":"bool","value":false},{"name":"drawn","type":"bool","value":true},{"name":"say","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"“Nothing goes out of here without the Lord's seal.”\", \"“没有主公的印信，这里一文也不出。”\", \"7afa2a261da6\"]]"},{"name":"gives","type":"string","value":"gold"},{"name":"gives_when","type":"string","value":"node:c7"},{"name":"give","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"The paymaster counts out a thousand taels of gold, a few dozen bright pearls and a jade belt, and makes you sign for each.\", \"支应官点出黄金一千两、明珠数十颗、玉带一条，每样都要你画押。\", \"d6394678e196\"]]"},{"name":"given","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"“A thousand taels, signed for. I hope he's worth it.”\", \"“一千两，已画押。但愿他值这个价。”\", \"b16740c0bd0f\"]]"}]},{"id":93,"name":"npc-3","type":"npc","x":344.0,"y":350.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true,"properties":[{"name":"kind","type":"string","value":"folk.soldier"},{"name":"sprite","type":"string","value":"f_soldier"},{"name":"wander","type":"bool","value":false},{"name":"drawn","type":"bool","value":true},{"name":"say","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"“The young general rides in front. No one in the Xiliang army can stand against him.”\", \"“那少年将军冲在最前面。西凉军中没人挡得住他。”\", \"3873a11a6265\"]]"}]},{"id":94,"name":"npc-4","type":"npc","x":1368.0,"y":478.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true,"properties":[{"name":"kind","type":"string","value":"folk.soldier"},{"name":"sprite","type":"string","value":"f_soldier"},{"name":"wander","type":"bool","value":false},{"name":"drawn","type":"bool","value":true},{"name":"say","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"“Thirty li we fell back. One man did that. One man and a halberd.”\", \"“退了三十里。就一个人。一个人，一杆戟。”\", \"af3cb68311b1\"]]"}]},{"id":95,"name":"pickets","type":"npc","x":536.0,"y":414.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true,"properties":[{"name":"kind","type":"string","value":"folk.soldier"},{"name":"sprite","type":"string","value":"f_soldier"},{"name":"wander","type":"bool","value":false},{"name":"drawn","type":"bool","value":true},{"name":"say","type":"string","value":"[]"},{"name":"challenge","type":"string","value":"pickets"},{"name":"until","type":"string","value":"13-c9"},{"name":"when","type":"string","value":"node:c8"},{"name":"view","type":"string","value":"4"},{"name":"intro","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"Pickets lying in ambush by the road spring up and surround you. “Who rides to General Lü's camp with a horse like that?”\", \"路旁埋伏的军人一跃而起，把你围住。“牵着这样一匹马，往吕将军营里去的是什么人？”\", \"8533747d561d\"]]"},{"name":"win","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"“…An old friend of the general's. Pass, then.”\", \"“……原来是将军的故人。过去吧。”\", \"4aebdd308571\"]]"},{"name":"done","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"The pickets wave you through.\", \"伏路军人挥手放行。\", \"ebc76f981af4\"]]"}]},{"id":96,"name":"scout","type":"npc","x":728.0,"y":222.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true,"properties":[{"name":"kind","type":"string","value":"folk.soldier"},{"name":"sprite","type":"string","value":"f_soldier"},{"name":"wander","type":"bool","value":false},{"name":"drawn","type":"bool","value":true},{"name":"say","type":"string","value":"[]"},{"name":"challenge","type":"string","value":"scout"},{"name":"until","type":"string","value":"13-c9"},{"name":"when","type":"string","value":"node:c8"},{"name":"view","type":"string","value":"4"},{"name":"intro","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"One of Ding Yuan's scouts reins in beside you. “Xiliang colours, and gifts. What does Dong Zhuo want with us?”\", \"丁原的一名探马勒马到你身旁。“打着西凉的旗号，还带着礼物。董卓想跟我们怎样？”\", \"81ed6278dd06\"]]"},{"name":"win","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"“…Peace, then. I hope so.”\", \"“……是求和吧。但愿如此。”\", \"40487b5d0b2c\"]]"},{"name":"done","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"The scout rides back to watch the road.\", \"探马回去守望大路。\", \"4e786fdc0584\"]]"}]},{"id":97,"name":"exit-the-camps--dy-tent","type":"exit","x":177.6,"y":237.6,"width":12.8,"height":7.2,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"properties":[{"name":"to","type":"string","value":"the-camps--dy-tent"},{"name":"side","type":"string","value":"N"}]},{"id":98,"name":"exit-the-camps--lb-tent","type":"exit","x":305.6,"y":237.6,"width":12.8,"height":7.2,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"properties":[{"name":"to","type":"string","value":"the-camps--lb-tent"},{"name":"side","type":"string","value":"N"}]},{"id":99,"name":"exit-the-camps--dz-tent","type":"exit","x":1201.6,"y":173.6,"width":12.8,"height":7.2,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"properties":[{"name":"to","type":"string","value":"the-camps--dz-tent"},{"name":"side","type":"string","value":"N"}]},{"id":100,"name":"exit-luoyang","type":"exit","x":1520,"y":384,"width":16,"height":64,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"properties":[{"name":"to","type":"string","value":"luoyang"},{"name":"side","type":"string","value":"E"}]},{"id":101,"name":"entry-the-camps--dy-tent","type":"entry","x":184.0,"y":254.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true,"properties":[{"name":"from","type":"string","value":"the-camps--dy-tent"}]},{"id":102,"name":"entry-the-camps--lb-tent","type":"entry","x":312.